  code_example_decomposition_request
    defined-by request
    role code_example_decomposition_cue
    precondition "the first line of a prompt asks for the parts of the code examples on the page the following lines supply"
    effect "the supplied-page route decomposes each code block in a registered grammar into its meaningful parts (issue 1164 R1164-11)"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "the parts of the code example"
    lexeme en
      words "parts of the code example" "parts of the code examples" "decompose the code example"
      words "decompose the code examples"
